  '''
  # Guide
  
  The policy table this project reads:
  
  ```toml
  [package.metadata.mytool]
  mode = "warn"
  ```
  
  A downstream application looks like:
  
  ```toml
  [package]
  name = "my-app"
  version = "0.1.0"
  ```
  
  Depend on the crate:
  
  ```toml
  [dependencies]
  alpha = "2.0.0"
  ```
  
  A workspace member inherits the version:
  
  ```toml
  [package]
  name = "alpha"
  version.workspace = true
  ```
  
  '''
